{"id":"lebensla_nglich","lemma":"lebenslänglich","pos":"adj","rank":4969,"glosses":["for life, life"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c9/De-lebensl%C3%A4nglich.ogg/De-lebensl%C3%A4nglich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Der Mann bekam „lebenslänglich“.","en":"The man was given a life sentence.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"man, male human being"},{"g":"to receive","l":"bekommen"},null]},{"text":"Drei bekamen lebenslänglich.","en":"Three were sentenced to life in prison.","words":[{"g":"three (numerical value…"},{"g":"to receive","l":"bekommen"},null]},{"text":"Tom hat lebenslänglich bekommen.","en":"Tom has been given a life sentence.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"to receive"}]},{"text":"Tom steht „lebenslänglich“ bevor.","en":"Tom is facing life in prison.","words":[null,{"g":"to stand","l":"stehen"},null,{"g":"before"}]},{"text":"Der Mann brach zusammen, als der Richter das Urteil \"lebenslänglich\" verkündete.","en":"The man went to pieces when the judge said he would have to go to prison for life.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"man, male human being"},{"g":"to break","l":"brechen"},{"g":"together"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"judge"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"judgment"},null,{"g":"to proclaim, pronounce","l":"verkünden"}]}]}